<title>USA: Price REIT sells center, records gain.</title>
<headline>Price REIT sells center, records gain.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price REIT Inc said Thursday it had sold a shopping center in Cerritos, Calif., for $17.4 million, which will result in a $4.2 million gain for the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, Chief Executive Officer Joseph Kornwasser said the sale is consistent with the company's strategy of selectively selling property and re-investing the proceeds into other property with long-term potential.</p>
<p>Price REIT is a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
